  "description": "Hexagon model, its centre, and affine wall projection. All14 named roles and seven correspondences remain. Central symmetry checks cover all three opposite pairs in both model and image; only source diagonals D1-A1 and D-A are drawn. The intrinsic regular model is shown in an affine screen view, not as screen-equal edges; the wall polygon is not asserted regular. Source E/C correspondence dash roles retained, with no extra exercise conclusion. Modern layout uses fixed640px scroll media even in240/346px viewports.",
